<h2 id="noweb-header-argument-expansion"><code>:noweb</code> header argument expansion</h2>
<pre id="noweb-example"><code class="language-emacs-lisp">(message "expanded1")
</code></pre>
<pre id="noweb-example2"><code class="language-emacs-lisp">(message "expanded2")
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-emacs-lisp">;; noweb-1-yes-start
  &#x3C;&#x3C;noweb-example>>
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-emacs-lisp">;; noweb-no-start
  &#x3C;&#x3C;noweb-example1>>
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-emacs-lisp">;; noweb-2-yes-start
  &#x3C;&#x3C;noweb-example2>>
</code></pre>
