<h2 id="detangle">detangle</h2>
<h3 id="false-positive">false positive</h3>
<p>The <code>[[</code> causes a false positive which <code>org-babel-detangle</code> should handle properly</p>
<pre><code class="language-emacs-lisp">(string-match-p "^#[[:digit:]]+$" "#123")
</code></pre>
